 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with the imperfect of **avoir** or **être** + past participle: **j'avais mangé** (I had eaten), **j'étais parti** (I had left).",
      "With **être**, the past participle agrees with the subject, as in the passé composé: **Elle était partie** (she had left)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When it is used",
     "texto": [
      "For an action that happened before another past action: **Quand je suis arrivé, il était déjà parti** (when I arrived, he had already left).",
      "Compare with English: in French «had» + past participle works just like in English."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
